odot/pull/115617.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115617.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes #106641\r\n\r\nInspector search currently matches against raw property paths, which may include URI encoding or dot-suffixed internal tags. This PR introduces a small normalization step when filtering properties in the Sectioned Inspector so that search queries operate on user-visible names instead.\r\n\r\nThe normalization:\r\n\r\n- decodes URI-encoded leaf names,\r\n- removes dot-suffixes from property names,\r\n- keeps section paths unchanged.\r\n\r\n\r\nWithout this fix you are able to search certain terms (like \"uuid\") and able to see categories that have all entries filtered\r\n\r\n4.5:\r\n<img width=\"1202\" height=\"732\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8c2b3a71-ff9c-4ccc-8fcf-4ec3c8de8b7f\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nThis PR:\r\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"725\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9a011028-f217-44f8-bcfa-a9f10a7cdc2b\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nAll this is accomplished using a new helper function in editor_sectioned_inspector.cpp\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115617/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115617/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}